This package's bounded, read-only graph canvas — its React Flow (@xyflow/react)
setup and its Dagre (@dagrejs/dagre) left-to-right auto-layout approach — is
derived from patterns in the Ladder Graph project, used under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. See the Ladder Graph LICENSE for terms.

  Ladder Graph — https://github.com/ (Apache-2.0)

Adaptations for StackGraph (not present in the original): read-only mode with no
connect/delete/drag-persist, StackGraph contract node/edge types (no LGIR/YAML),
domain-badged nodes, dashed "uncertain bridge" edges, selection-scoped bridge
pulse, aggregate cluster nodes, a hard ~50 real-node render cap, and Strata design
tokens replacing all Ladder-specific colors, fonts, and icons.
